WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Like a turtle shell

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:04,650
I don't believe he has no flaws

3
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:10,490
I don’t even believe that he will never go out like this for the rest of his life.

4
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:12,370
Let's move next door to his house

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,080
Keep an eye on him in shifts

6
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,600
As long as he dares to miss the mark, kill him directly

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,340
And live in a high-rise

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:23,900
It’s safer to guard against those crazy dogs downstairs, yes, yes, yes, Brother Hao is right.

9
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:32,620
I go to the bathroom

10
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:41,630
Chen Zhenghao is going to move next door to your house and spy on you

11
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:44,430
When you go out for revenge, be careful.
